1. Geographies that do not work properly.
1991 census tracts
Some vector tiles have information in second block:
example:
1991_ct Polygon
missing ID
CA	933
CT_NAME	238.01
CA_CTNAME	933238.01
1991_ct Polygon
missing ID
CA	933
CT_NAME	238.01
CT_CODE	3924
PROV	59
program expects the first block to have all the needed information.

2001-2006 dissemination areas and 1996 to 2006 census tracts show values but are grey in colour.

1981 provinces, census divisions, census subdivisions show values but are grey in colour.
1986 provinces, census subdivisions show values but are grey in colour.
1991 provinces, census divisions, census subdivisions show values but are grey in colour.

2021: FED 2023 does not work. For FED 2023: Value is N/A.